OL,3,ARussell Brand sentenced to
OL,4,A10-and-a-half years in prison for rape
OL,5,Aand sexual assault
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent.
OL,10,FRussell Brand has been sentenced to 10
OL,11,Fyears and six months in prison, after
OL,12,Fbeing convicted of rape and sexual
OL,13,Fassault.
OL,15,FIn his sentencing remarks, Judge Joel
OL,16,FBennathan, described Brand as a "sexual
OL,17,Fpredator" and criticised his
OL,18,F"staggering arrogance".
